  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is San Pedro a good investment in 2025?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"San Pedro is one of the most compelling investment stories in the South Bay. The West Harbor waterfront redevelopment, ongoing downtown investment, and proximity to Rancho Palos Verdes create multiple appreciation catalysts. 90732 has been appreciating at 8%+ year-over-year."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use an FHA loan in San Pedro?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — especially in 90731 where median prices around $800K are within FHA parameters. 90732 coastal properties are increasingly above the FHA ceiling but conventional financing remains widely available."}}]}</script>
